cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use tooltrim in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "tooltrim: Faithful, Query-Aware Compression of LLM Agent Tool Outputs"
abstract: >-
  A drop-in, provider-agnostic library that compresses LLM agent tool outputs
  before they re-enter context, using a content-type router (HTML/JSON/logs/
  tabular/text) and query-aware extraction while keeping the full output
  retrievable on demand via a content-addressed store. Ships a reproducible
  benchmark harness (Tool-Output Faithfulness Benchmark, frontier accuracy/token
  Pareto, end-to-end agent tasks) and a pre-registered, placebo-controlled
  live-agent evaluation on tau-bench.
